               <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/I6R8Q66K"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Tasfa1955Saatat"/><title level="m">&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;ሰዓታት። ዘሌሊት፡ ወዘነግህ። (&lt;/hi&gt;Saʿātāt. Za-lelit wa-za-nagh&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, ‘The Book of the Hours. Of the night and of the morning’)&lt;/hi&gt;</title><editor><name>Tasfā Gabra Śǝllāse</name></editor><pubPlace>ʾAddis ʾAbabā</pubPlace><publisher>Tasfā Gabra Śǝllāse māttamiyā bet</publisher><date>1954</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Book of Hours</note><note type="tag">Horologium</note><note type="tag">bm:Tasfa1955Saatat</note></note><note type="tag">Book of Hours</note><note type="tag">Horologium</note><note type="tag">bm:Tasfa1955Saatat</note><t:citedRange unit="page">78–80</t:citedRange></t:bibl>
